{"headline": "National HackFest 2026 Championship Victory", "body": "Event: National HackFest 2026 Championship.

Date: September 5, 2026.

SIET engineering student team secured First Prize and bagged Gold Medal with cash award of INR 50,000 at the National HackFest. The team was led by Dr. K. Arunkumar. Organizers commended their automated smart irrigation solution.", "date": "September 5, 2026", "people": ["Dr. K. Arunkumar"], "organization": "Information Technology", "achievement_result": "First Prize"}

{"headline": "Autonomous Solar Boat Capstone Project Expo", "body": "Event: Final Year Engineering Project Showcase.

Date: October 14, 2026.

Mechanical Engineering and Electrical Engineering students presented their Autonomous Solar Boat prototype. The system operates on dual solar panels and GPS navigation. Coordinated by Prof. R. Senthil.", "date": "October 14, 2026", "people": ["Prof. R. Senthil"], "organization": "Mechanical Engineering", "achievement_result": null}

{"headline": "SIET CSE Department Launches High-Performance AI Computing Facility", "body": "Department of Computer Science & Engineering, SIET.

Date: August 12, 2026.

Establishment of new High-Performance Computing cluster with 8 NVIDIA GPUs for AI research funded by Institutional Research Grant of INR 35 Lakhs. Lead Coordinator: Dr. V. Muralidharan, Professor & Head of CSE. Intended users: Final-year B.E. and M.E. scholars working on autonomous robotics and vision models.", "date": "August 12, 2026", "people": ["Dr. V. Muralidharan"], "organization": "Institutional Research Grant of INR 35 Lakhs", "achievement_result": "INR 35 Lakhs"}

